{"version":1,"content":"<p>鄧麗欣（Stephy）相隔14年推出全新專輯《Tathātā》，今次打破既有形象，以冷艷神秘「暗黑女王」造型亮眼登場。</p><p>專輯概念融合西方古典油畫視覺，貫穿「過去、現在、未來」的非線性時間軸，展現成熟蛻變與初心不變的音樂哲學。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T09:02:27.757057+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":112,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T08:07:12+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T02:57:40.223762+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T08:57:38.183206+00:00","content_hash":"c3a0cbe285047ee435c99baf1766aaf8e3135ed4606000a5d673ca924fca3cc9","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}